<BaseLayout title="Resources">
  <h1>Resources</h1>
  <p>Start with the official Volvo owner information for the correct model year and market. Use factory technical information for repairs, wiring, torque values, programming and diagnostic procedures. Community posts and aftermarket catalogues are useful discovery tools, not final fitment authority.</p>
  <h2>Official owner information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="https://www.volvocars.com/us/support/car/s60/20w46">Volvo Cars US — 2021 S60 owner's information</a> — primary reference for North American owner instructions and equipment descriptions.</li>
    <li><a href="https://www.volvocars.com/uk/support/car/s60/2021/article/f3e117dc70239324c0a801513d2de23c/">Engine-compartment overview</a> — Volvo's labeled 2021 illustration and safety notes.</li>
    <li><a href="https://www.volvocars.com/uk/support/car/s60/20w17/article/b0804d54c7fc096bc0a801f6f065ad63e/8899be1dc7fc78b1c0a801f6f5a01b4ab/7fb6d49c716ec36fc0a801516fb09741/">Engine oil specifications</a> — published engine-code, grade and approximate-volume table.</li>
    <li><a href="https://www.volvocars.com/en-ca/support/car/s60/2021/article/1f2a2f75c7fab5e2c0a81f6f0da34d7b/b57a901ec7fb8a47c0a81f6f57625c84/17762fea7060dde3c0a8015177d4c520/">Fuses and central electrical units</a> — location schematic and fuse safety warnings.</li>
    <li><a href="https://www.volvocars.com/is/support/car/s60/article/b14387177026a34ac0a801515dd998cb/">Checking and filling engine oil</a> — electronic oil-level display and measurement conditions.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Service and technical information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="https://www.volvotechinfo.com/">Volvo Technical Information</a> — official service information access for repair procedures, wiring and diagnostics.</li>
    <li><a href="https://www.volvocars.com/images/cs/v3/assets/bltccbab8edae0354cd/blt69f9c7b68d8fc5da/6846f0068fb0326a6e553940/2020-2021_FSM_Maintenance_Form_ICE-updated.pdf">Volvo Car USA — 2020/2021 factory maintenance operations PDF</a> — non-hybrid maintenance reference; do not apply wholesale to T8 Recharge.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Use sources carefully</h2>
  <p>Volvo support pages may use regional terminology or list equipment not sold in North America. Confirm model year, engine, market, build date and VIN before applying a value or procedure. See <a href="./source-notes/">Source notes and accuracy</a> for the site's source hierarchy and known limitations.</p>
</BaseLayout>
